---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT a FROM t LEFT SEMI JOIN u ON t.a = u.a AND u.a < 3
---
Join LeftSemi, (a#0 == a#3)
:- Filter (isnotnull(a#0) and (a#0 < 3))
:  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
+- Filter (isnotnull(a#3) and (a#3 < 3))
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
